{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773084971,"nonce":"34kcW7MIN/alwna2ik7fCMHBPU4=","title":"GraphView P2: D3 SVG graph renderer component","message":"Part of umbrella issue #fe566dc.\n\nImplement the standalone D3 graph rendering component:\n- `ui/src/components/graph/GraphCanvas.tsx` — D3 SVG force-directed simulation; renders typed `{ nodes, edges }` data\n- `ui/src/components/graph/GraphTooltip.tsx` — hover tooltip showing key fields per node type\n- `ui/src/views/graph.tsx` — full GraphView page: fetches from `/api/graph`, owns filter state (repo, recency, status), renders GraphCanvas + toolbar\n- Node visual design: sessions pulse when active; auth requests colored by urgency status; issues colored by label (umbrella=purple, error=red, feature=blue, deferred=gray); branches as small rectangles\n- Animation: session nodes drift toward attached issue nodes, edge appears/dissolves as sessions attach/detach\n- Click node → dispatch a custom `graph:navigate` event with `{ type, id, repoId }` (integration partition wires this to hash navigation)\n- Hover → tooltip\n- CSS in `ui/src/style.css` for graph-specific styles\n\nExport interface: `GraphView` default export as a Preact component with props: `{ onNavigate: (type, id, repoId?) =\u003e void }`\n\nNote: d3 must be added to package.json.","files":null}]}